@startuml
title EKA-57: repository catalog to assistant context

participant "Legacy SQL seed" as SQL
participant "Python seed catalog" as PY
participant "Manual deploy" as DEPLOY
database "knowledge_base" as DB
participant "CI tests" as CI
participant "Agent retrieval" as RAG
participant "Prompt" as PROMPT

SQL -> DB : manual DELETE + 17-row INSERT (H1)
PY -> DB : manual 14-row upsert, no deletion (H2)
note over SQL,PY
Two divergent authorities can coexist.
Duplicates and stale rows survive.
end note

DEPLOY -> DEPLOY : rebuild changed containers (H4)
note right of DEPLOY
No KB sync or drift check.
end note

CI -> CI : training module seeks ignored private file (H6)
CI -> CI : missing file -> skip

DB -> RAG : priority order, LIMIT 20 (H7)
RAG -> PROMPT : scored top 5 or priority fallback

note over PY,DB
Required technical path:
one catalog -> transactional exact sync -> check
end note
note over DEPLOY,CI
Deploy invokes sync + check;
CI proves behavior and uses a tracked question-only fixture.
end note
@enduml
